flowchart TD
 O[Locked plan R1 on v1] --> P[Select target v5]
 P --> D[Dry-run task / assessment compatibility]
 D --> C{Decision for each obligation}
 C --> A[Carry-over accepted result]
 C --> B[Supplement / reassess]
 C --> N[New required work]
 C --> R[Retired / manual review]
 A --> S[Preview new denominator, credit and deadlines]
 B --> S
 N --> S
 R --> S
 S --> H{Staff approval?}
 H -- No --> O
 H -- Yes --> T[Atomic create plan revision R2]
 T --> E[Append migration audit and recalculate metrics]
 E --> F[Display v1 history and v5 current progress separately]
